                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>With a whir of clockwork mechanisms, spinning gears, and grinding bones, the clockwork corpse opens its torso and disgorges a pressurized spray of festering internal fluids and caustic oil in a @Template[type:line|distance:30]. Creatures in the area are dealt @Damage[3d6[bludgeoning],3d6[poison]|options:area-damage]{3d6 bludgeoning damage and 3d6 poison damage} (@Check[reflex|dc:22|basic|options:area-effect,inflicts:prone] save). On a critical failure, a creature is additionally knocked @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Prone] by the force. The clockwork corpse can't use Pressurized Blast again for [[/gmr 1d4 #Recharge Pressurized Blast]]{1d4 rounds}.</p>"
                },
